"""
Minimal Flask API exposing the current user's profile.

CORS notes:
- Credentialed requests (cookies) require an explicit Access-Control-Allow-Origin;
  the "*" wildcard is rejected by browsers when credentials are used.
- So we echo back the request Origin only if it's in an allow-list.
